Key algorithmic details:

- **`Compare`**: collects all replica IDs from both clocks, checks `a[id] <= b[id]` (→ `aLessEq`) and `b[id] <= a[id]` (→ `bLessEq`). The switch on `(aLessEq, bLessEq)` yields the causal ordering.
