- [`main.go`](main.go) — contains `BuggyValues` (buggy) and `FixedValues` (fixed), plus `main()` demo
- [`main_test.go`](main_test.go) — self-tests that catch the off-by-one panic and validate the fix
- [`go.mod`](go.mod) — Go 1.26 module

