The function claims to be inclusive of both `start` and `end`, but the `i < end` condition excludes `end`. The test `TestInclusiveRange_Normal` caught this: expected `[1 2 3 4 5]`, got `[1 2 3 4]`. Test `TestInclusiveRange_Single` catches the edge case `(3, 3)` — returned `[]` instead of `[3]`.

